=== Expected game length (fair game) ===
E[turns] = a * b for symmetric random walk until absorption.
  E[turns | a=1, b=1] = 1
  E[turns | a=1, b=2] = 2
  E[turns | a=1, b=3] = 3
  E[turns | a=1, b=4] = 4
  E[turns | a=1, b=5] = 5
